WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
I'm not here to put up a show and just keep an empty room in the courtyard.

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:07,310
You are a cold and distant person

3
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:11,670
Is it possible that you have all these thoughts?

4
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:13,190
My son has no intention of doing so

5
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:14,430
Since there is no

6
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,130
Then you should pay more attention

7
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:17,890
I urged you to get married in the first place

8
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:20,470
It’s because I watch you hanging out together all day long.

9
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:22,870
I hope someone can warm up your days

10
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:26,090
But I didn’t ask you to marry anyone you want and come back to me

11
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:28,170
If you have no feelings for Ayu at all

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:29,290
Why marry him

13
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,990
Married and left in the cold

14
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:35,080
Aren't you meeting someone?

15
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,120
Go back today and think about it carefully

16
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,820
If you want to understand

17
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:42,210
I will personally go to the Song family to pick him up early tomorrow morning.

18
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,410
If you can't understand
